In the forest of Whistling Pines, Elara comes across a series of puzzles carved into the trunk of an ancient tree. The puzzles involve arranging stones in specific patterns and deciphering cryptic clues. As she solves each puzzle, parts of the map become clearer, revealing more about the location of the treasure. However, she also discovers that she is not alone in her quest. A group of mercenaries, led by the ruthless Captain Blackwood, is hot on her trail, hoping to claim the treasure for themselves.

{
